OL,3,GNEWSA'I wouldn't be here today if it
OL,4,Awasn't for Hollyoaks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mental health campaigner said they
OL,7,Fwere seconds away from taking their own
OL,8,Flife before being saved by a plotline
OL,9,Fin a soap opera.
OL,11,FJohn Junior, 37, from Wythenshawe, in
OL,12,FGreater Manchester, had been suffering
OL,13,Fwith depression since the age of 14.
OL,14,FBut after the sudden death of their
OL,15,Ffather in 2018, the then-IT worker said
OL,16,Fthey hit rock bottom.
OL,18,FDuring lockdown in 2020, John was
OL,19,Fcontemplating taking their own life
OL,20,Fwhen a Hollyoaks storyline stopped them
OL,21,Fin their tracks.
